
### 生成请参签名数据(生产)

POST {{host}}/rsaSign
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8
Accept: application/json

{
  "platformAppId": "SM20261018160002",
  "signType": "RSA",
  "alipayAppId": "9021000169679124",
  "version": "1.0",
  "fileId": "59900014",
  "priKey": "{{partnerPriKey}}"
}

